  "title": "Global Regulatory & Statutory Open Metadata Index (2024–2026) — 30,746 Official Dossiers",
  "creators": [
    {
      "name": "Global Data Index",
      "affiliation": "Global Data Index (globaldataindex.org)"
    }
  ],
  "description": "<p>Automated, machine-readable bibliographic metadata catalog (CSV and JSONL) indexing <strong>30,746</strong> official primary and secondary laws, final and proposed rules, statutory instruments, and multilateral resolutions across <strong>474</strong> government departments, ministries, regulatory agencies, and multilateral organs across active jurisdictions: <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-states/'>United States</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-kingdom/'>United Kingdom</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/canada/'>Canada</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/european-union/'>European Union</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/australia/'>Australia</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/united-nations/'>United Nations</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/ireland/'>Ireland</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/international/'>International</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/south-africa/'>South Africa</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/india/'>India</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/japan/'>Japan</a>, <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/sweden/'>Sweden</a>.</p><p>Full plain-English executive briefings, structured HTML compliance matrices, semantic definition lists, two-stage Tables of Contents, authority RSS syndication feeds, and unabridged source PDF dossiers are accessible via each record's canonical URL on <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/'>https://www.globaldataindex.org</a> and the <a href='https://www.globaldataindex.org/methodology/'>Complete Issuing Authority Directory</a>.</p>",
